# Release signing material (Phase 5, Ruling 6): NO keystore is committed.
# The release build reads its signing properties from OUTSIDE the repo
# (user-home gradle.properties or -P flags — docs/release/signing.md);
# this rule is the belt-and-braces guarantee that a keystore dropped
# anywhere in the tree can never be committed by accident.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.keystore.b64

# Native libraries staged by the composeApp `buildRust` task from the Rust
# workspace; they are build outputs, rebuilt via cargo-ndk on every preBuild.
composeApp/src/main/jniLibs/
